  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 88f6fa2b89436164b8e97b17d82dc9a2, type: 3}
  m_Name: 6 - Upgrade
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: UtilityScriptIWrite::HintSO
  hintId: tutorial_upgrade
  isUnlockedByDefault: 1
  ignoreLock: 0
  title: Upgrade System
  image: {fileID: 0}
  description: '<b>Upgrade System</b>


    You can unlock or improve multiple systems
    through the Upgrade menu.


    To perform an upgrade, you must first meet its
    requirements. These may include completing other upgrades, finishing puzzle levels,
    or progressing through exploration content.


    In addition, each upgrade requires
    a sufficient amount of collected resources.


    Some upgrades are multi-tiered
    and can be improved over time, while others are one-time unlocks that grant new
    abilities or systems.


    Most importantly, upgrades are used to unlock essential
    technologies required to repair and restore your ship, enabling further progression
    in your journey.'
  isImageBig: 0
